# Built binary (`go build -o awa ./cmd/awa` in the repo root).
/awa

# GoReleaser's output: archives, checksums, and the per-target binaries. Generated
# only, never committed.
/dist/

# The generated site (`just site`). A build artifact: a checkout regenerates it from
# the binary, and a committed copy would become a second documentation tree.
/site/dist/

# Go test/coverage artifacts.
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt

# Editor/OS noise.
.DS_Store

# User-local registry of repositories where awa is dogfooded.
/.awa-integrations.local.md

# Local credentials and provider configuration.
/.env
/.wrangler/
